namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIBehaviour {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIBehaviour.h#DreamUIBehaviour
    src   "Base class for DreamUI's life cycle behaviour related component.\nAwake execute order in prefab: higher in hierarchy will execute earlier, so scripts on root widget will execute the first."
    text  "DreamUI生命周期行为相关组件的基类。\n预制体中Awake的执行顺序：层级越高越先执行，因此根控件上的脚本将最先执行。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIBehaviour:GetAnimationPlayer {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIBehaviour.h#DreamUIBehaviour:GetAnimationPlayer
    src   "Finds the prefab animation host on this widget or the nearest parent widget."
    text  "在此控件或最近的父控件上查找预制体动画宿主。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIBehaviour:ReceiveAwake {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIBehaviour.h#DreamUIBehaviour:ReceiveAwake
    src   "This function is always called before any Start functions and also after a prefab is loaded.\nAwake execute order in prefab: higher in hierarchy will execute earlier, so scripts on root widget will execute the first."
    text  "此函数始终在任何Start函数之前调用，且在预制体加载之后调用。\n预制体中Awake的执行顺序：层级越高越先执行，因此根控件上的脚本将最先执行。"
    state machine
}

